          "text": "Nabambanywe na Kristo, ariko ndiho; yamara si jewe nkiriho, ni Kristo ariho muri jewe. Ivyo nkora vyose nkiriho mu mubiri mbikoreshwa no kwizera Umwana w’Imana yankunze, akanyigura. ",
